; fkwu-many-voices-live-run.fk -- the runnable door for the many-voices lane.
;
; Same finding preflight-run.fk and voice-frequency-run.fk record: a practice
; that costs a scaffold before it can be used will be skipped when it is most
; needed. One command runs the whole live lane -- three simultaneous speakers,
; three languages, per-channel hearing, local translation, the merged neutral
; feed, the mixture honesty row, the neutral voice out, and the summary:
;
;   ./fkwu presence/fkwu-many-voices-live-run.fk
;
; Artifacts land under audio-training-runs/current/fkwu-many-voices-live/
; (feed.tsv is the neutral feed; summary carries the measured numbers).
; Answers the twelve-bit score; 4095 is all-clear, 0 is not-ready.
;
; preludes: form-stdlib/core.fk presence/fkwu-many-voices-live.fk

(fmv-run-current)
